/*
  OverviewTab.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0059 · OverviewTab (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `OverviewTab`
  resolves (table "OverviewTab") lives here with its web English value. These entries fold
  into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the
  shared catalog.

  The first group holds the keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/analytics/components/analytics/OverviewTab.tsx) — the canonical
  `analytics.overview.*` and `analytics.links.*` namespaces. The remaining keys back the
  native-only chrome (freshness chip, stale/offline banner, loading + error + retry copy).
*/

